Zen's generated contextual-prediction table is derived from SUBTLEX-UK word
bigram frequencies published by Walter van Heuven, Pawel Mandera, Emmanuel
Keuleers and Marc Brysbaert.

Source: https://psychology.nottingham.ac.uk/subtlex-uk/
Archive SHA-256: 97abc5dc993586c88a93458ad29e7e6a50b8d20e0d7d50601b0a2bb0f9d3c1e8

Citation:
van Heuven, W. J. B., Mandera, P., Keuleers, E., & Brysbaert, M. (2014).
SUBTLEX-UK: A new and improved word frequency database for British English.
The Quarterly Journal of Experimental Psychology, 67, 1176-1190.
https://doi.org/10.1080/17470218.2013.850521

The original dataset is not redistributed by this repository. The generated
table contains only ranked dictionary-word identifiers selected for Zen.
